```console
$ scherzo-cloud project repository --help
Manage a project's repository binding

Usage: scherzo-cloud project repository [COMMAND]

Commands:
  remove  Remove a project's repository binding
  set     Bind or replace a project's repository
  show    Show a project's repository binding
  update  Change a project's configured default branch
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
